<p>still alive. about a decade has passed since the big monome modular wave but everything is open-source and @dewb made them all work with <a href="https://monome.org/docs/grid/computer/vcv-rack/">vcv rack</a> which is a free virtual modular software platform.</p>
<p>these virtual versions are identical to the hardware originals. and since vcv runs on linux this is an excellent opportunity to rescue an old abandoned computer, give it a new operating system and a new musical life.</p>
<p>the video above prefers viewing with bass.</p>
<p>and it's the end of the year. use code TWENTYTWENTYSIX for 20% off everything.</p>
